<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States has begun direct talks with Myanmar’s generals and lifted sanctions on a military‑linked businessman’s daughter, while Min Aung Hlaing met Malaysia’s leadership. The junta’s army launched major strikes, including an airstrike that injured one person near a hospital in Myebon and another that killed seven in Sin Ai Village, and it attacked a Naga insurgent camp killing 36. It is enforcing strict conscription quotas, prompting youth fears of abduction for forced service, and militia forces have desecrated a Christian place of worship. The conflict caused 2,332 battle‑related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNMzkzT0s5ZXp3d0d0ZmRSUkx1VG1mUmhfdU5jUVQ2UU0waVZuLVRVVGRiT2JwekpzRDBqX0p6bDdvM2FKdTVGRU5HSkZyc2hDdDRXbUJaajdYcGk5Uk1aaUxTRVlLX1lYNjExTEpDdzVrTFdsRGtxLUJ1NGZoRHBoNTRIQ1lTX191aUx6RXU2amI4cWduSEh3YUlUQldJVW44?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tamil Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE81cUwzVENRMVE0LTFSc1BCcXZ5UHZaZ09Ya18xYlhyY0w4TmNkQXlMSHdidE5PbzhuZUZ6VWs3eGNxckdTSzk5UzFwRUZIaUtVdHV1clN1REVXQ1hMOXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPRlZmc09RZFVhUlE3WG16cWR0azlhVnJ4ZTA4ZDZBLVo1QWVaUnNHR2xLNkdHVjNwX2p6Yk1oS0VPVW1hOEVTZW5qekpkOHNpSGZRMDdjVFlxc1R1OHctUDIzQWo1NnZTaWRRMUdyT2RfYWIxenhKZk5BVWNhclRHdzl1OUdvRVI5WWIwaTJjZGp4cEpyUDB1V05MME1zaUNu?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tamil Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQVUFVbnVmcWpRcE9GQmQ4V2NkV0NqMmlEMF9tZzZmWlRWcmpEYVJaM280czZxTW5hM1JPZjRGQ2lVNzlDd2ZjQi1mSDN4WlltNk5xLTNVNWNjMEVYSHZ2WVI3R2JlVnFvRWdZWUl2Z1FzcVJ0NmhIOG04T2ZzYl8ta0hfa21kRjNQV01XLUZ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;,